      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FUTURE DEVELOPMENT -->
  <section class="eh-section" aria-labelledby="eh-growing" href="https://clark.libguides.com/c.php?g=1565192&p=11748470">
    <h2 id="eh-growing">A collection in progress</h2>
    <p>
      These procedures are designed to get the collection started
      without creating unnecessary work. As materials arrive and
      staff gain experience, we may refine item types, add inventory
      fields, develop additional discovery tools, and create ways
      for students and visitors to browse selected materials online.
    </p>
    <p>
      The staff inventory remains an internal working tool.
      Any public-facing discovery resource will use appropriately
      selected information and respect donor permissions and
      restrictions.
    </p>
  </section>

  <div class="eh-footer">
